{"model": "anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "Extract facts separately for EVERY candidate from its primary scope, quote, pilot and rollout records. Reports may contain mistakes. Return choice, confidence, a recorded-only verification request, limitations, and candidate_facts. Each group contains typed values, one supplied citation and an exact supporting excerpt (at most 600 characters) from that document. Each group includes unknown_fields: list the names of unconfirmed/missing fields there, and use these inert placeholders only for those fields: empty string for region, 0 for numeric/count, false for boolean, [0,0,0] for stage_days. Unknown fields normalize to null before comparison; placeholders never count as facts. If no source citation exists use an empty citation and excerpt. Do not convert a future mitigation into confirmation. Scope: storage_region and processing_region. Quote: seat_price per seat/month, outcome_price per automated resolution, setup_usd, sso, complete_export. Pilot: simple_resolved/simple_total and complex_resolved/complex_total. Rollout: stage_days, exactly three sequential stages. Do not substitute advertised fresh-account setup for buyer migration. Do not classify PASS/FAIL, change buyer thresholds, or compare total operating cost with a software-only budget. Policy comparisons will be calculated separately. A qualitative limitation is not a new mandatory requirement. Keep limitations under 300 characters. Provisional choice is not authority to purchase. Return exactly one JSON object matching the supplied response schema. Do not include Markdown, code fences or text outside that object."}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"phase\": \"initial\", \"brief\": {\"company\": \"SaaS renewal support\", \"seats\": 21, \"monthly_tickets\": 3200, \"complex_share\": 0.51, \"months\": 12, \"human_cost_per_unresolved_ticket\": 9, \"deadline_days\": 46, \"software_budget_usd\": 74000, \"minimum_automation\": 0.35, \"cost_tolerance_fraction\": 0.03, \"requirements\": [\"EU ticket storage AND EU inference processing must be confirmed for this deployment\", \"SSO and complete export required\", \"migration finishes before deadline\"], \"decision_rule\": \"Choose a supported feasible option within 3% of minimum year-one total cost. Total cost includes software, usage, setup and residual human handling. If none is supported, DEFER with a named missing fact. Do not infer deployment scope from generic marketing. The pilot is a planning scenario, not a population guarantee.\"}, \"candidates\": [\"Aster\", \"Birch\", \"Cobalt\"], \"documents\": [{\"id\": \"comparison-2\", \"title\": \"Implementation digest\", \"kind\": \"comparison\", \"publisher\": \"comparison-desk\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Editorial note: compare contract scope and buyer workload before relying on headline prices. This page has no additional product measurements.\"}, {\"id\": \"rollout-1\", \"title\": \"Aster dependency-based rollout estimate\", \"kind\": \"implementation\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-integration\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Aster: export mapping 7 days, integration and region activation 25 days, acceptance 7 days; stages sequential. The vendor advertises 14 days for a fresh account without historical migration. This buyer needs migration.\"}, {\"id\": \"quote-1\", \"title\": \"Aster deployment quote\", \"kind\": \"contract\", \"publisher\": \"Aster-commercial\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Aster: $83 per seat per month for 12 months; $0.2 per automated resolution, no free allowance; one-time setup $8650. A resolution avoids one human-handled ticket in this planning model. SSO included: True; complete export: True. No other discounts are committed.\"}, {\"id\": \"pilot-2\", \"title\": \"Birch buyer pilot\", \"kind\": \"pilot\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-pilot\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: resolved 56 of 100 simple tickets and 43 of 100 complex tickets. Use workload-weighted rates for planning. Counts are synthetic observations, not a measured product benchmark. Pilot did not measure production drift.\"}, {\"id\": \"quote-0\", \"title\": \"Cobalt deployment quote\", \"kind\": \"contract\", \"publisher\": \"Cobalt-commercial\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Cobalt: $27 per seat per month for 12 months; $0.11 per automated resolution, no free allowance; one-time setup $3250. A resolution avoids one human-handled ticket in this planning model. SSO included: True; complete export: True. No other discounts are committed.\"}, {\"id\": \"rollout-2\", \"title\": \"Birch dependency-based rollout estimate\", \"kind\": \"implementation\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-integration\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: export mapping 7 days, integration and region activation 11 days, acceptance 7 days; stages sequential. The vendor advertises 14 days for a fresh account without historical migration. This buyer needs migration.\"}, {\"id\": \"workload\", \"title\": \"Operations export and approval brief\", \"kind\": \"internal\", \"publisher\": \"buyer\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"3200 monthly tickets; 51% are complex. 21 support seats. Human handling costs $9 per unresolved ticket. Annual software cash ceiling $74000. Rollout must complete in 46 days. Historical easy-ticket demo mix was 10% complex; use our current mix, not that demo.\"}, {\"id\": \"comparison-0\", \"title\": \"Market shortlist\", \"kind\": \"comparison\", \"publisher\": \"comparison-desk\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Comparison desk recommends Cobalt. Seat-only annual price for this team is $6804; usage, setup and remaining human work are separate. EU hosting is available, subject to the deployment scope. Fresh-account setup is advertised at 14 days; migration differs. Demo performance uses a different ticket mix. Compare the actual quote and pilot before deciding.\"}, {\"id\": \"scope-1\", \"title\": \"Aster deployment scope\", \"kind\": \"deployment\", \"publisher\": \"Aster-security\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Aster: ticket storage region EU; inference processing region EU. This deployment-specific response supersedes the general 'EU hosting available' brochure. Unknown is not approval; requirement is buyer policy, not a legal conclusion.\"}, {\"id\": \"scope-2\", \"title\": \"Birch deployment scope\", \"kind\": \"deployment\", \"publisher\": \"Birch-security\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: ticket storage region EU; inference processing region EU. This deployment-specific response supersedes the general 'EU hosting available' brochure. Unknown is not approval; requirement is buyer policy, not a legal conclusion.\"}, {\"id\": \"pilot-1\", \"title\": \"Aster buyer pilot\", \"kind\": \"pilot\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-pilot\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Aster: resolved 79 of 100 simple tickets and 71 of 100 complex tickets. Use workload-weighted rates for planning. Counts are synthetic observations, not a measured product benchmark. Pilot did not measure production drift.\"}, {\"id\": \"quote-2\", \"title\": \"Birch deployment quote\", \"kind\": \"contract\", \"publisher\": \"Birch-commercial\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: $18 per seat per month for 12 months; $0.03 per automated resolution, no free allowance; one-time setup $2350. A resolution avoids one human-handled ticket in this planning model. SSO included: True; complete export: True. No other discounts are committed.\"}, {\"id\": \"rollout-0\", \"title\": \"Cobalt dependency-based rollout estimate\", \"kind\": \"implementation\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-integration\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Cobalt: export mapping 7 days, integration and region activation 58 days, acceptance 7 days; stages sequential. The vendor advertises 14 days for a fresh account without historical migration. This buyer needs migration.\"}, {\"id\": \"comparison-1\", \"title\": \"Buyer checklist\", \"kind\": \"comparison\", \"publisher\": \"comparison-desk\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Editorial note: compare contract scope and buyer workload before relying on headline prices. This page has no additional product measurements.\"}, {\"id\": \"scope-0\", \"title\": \"Cobalt deployment scope\", \"kind\": \"deployment\", \"publisher\": \"Cobalt-security\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Cobalt: ticket storage region EU; inference processing region UNCONFIRMED. This deployment-specific response supersedes the general 'EU hosting available' brochure. Unknown is not approval; requirement is buyer policy, not a legal conclusion.\"}, {\"id\": \"pilot-0\", \"title\": \"Cobalt buyer pilot\", \"kind\": \"pilot\", \"publisher\": \"buyer-pilot\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Cobalt: resolved 92 of 100 simple tickets and 83 of 100 complex tickets. Use workload-weighted rates for planning. Counts are synthetic observations, not a measured product benchmark. Pilot did not measure production drift.\"}], \"reports\": [{\"choice\": \"Birch\", \"confidence\": 0.72, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"Birch meets cost ceiling: $18\\u00d721\\u00d712 + $2350 + $0.03\\u00d71,881 automated = $66,186 total, within $74k budget and 3% tolerance vs. minimum.\", \"citations\": [\"quote-2\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Complex workload (51%) requires automation verification: 1,881 annual automated resolutions needed to stay under budget; Birch's $0.03/resolution cost is lowest but automation capability unconfirmed.\", \"citations\": [\"workload\", \"quote-2\"]}, {\"claim\": \"EU hosting and inference processing not confirmed in any quote; SSO and export present in all three; migration timeline (46 days) and pilot scope remain unvalidated.\", \"citations\": [\"quote-0\", \"quote-1\", \"quote-2\", \"workload\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Birch\", \"kind\": \"pilot\"}}, {\"choice\": \"DEFER\", \"confidence\": 0.0, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"Cobalt inference processing region is UNCONFIRMED; EU processing requirement cannot be verified.\", \"citations\": [\"scope-0\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Aster and Birch both confirm EU ticket storage AND EU inference processing as required.\", \"citations\": [\"scope-1\", \"scope-2\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Cost worksheet is empty; cannot calculate total year-one cost including usage, setup, and residual human handling against $74k budget.\", \"citations\": [\"workload\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Cobalt\", \"kind\": \"scope\"}}, {\"choice\": \"DEFER\", \"confidence\": 0.15, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"Aster rollout 39 days (7+25+7) exceeds 46-day deadline with 7-day margin; Birch 25 days fits comfortably; Cobalt 72 days (7+58+7) fails deadline.\", \"citations\": [\"rollout-1\", \"rollout-2\", \"rollout-0\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"EU ticket storage and inference processing confirmation absent for all three candidates; comparison-0 notes EU hosting 'subject to deployment scope' but provides no vendor commitment.\", \"citations\": [\"comparison-0\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Cost worksheet empty; cannot verify total year-one cost (software, usage, setup, residual human handling) against $74k budget or 3% tolerance rule.\", \"citations\": [\"workload\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Birch\", \"kind\": \"contract\"}}, {\"choice\": \"DEFER\", \"confidence\": 0.15, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"Cobalt pilot shows highest automation (92% simple, 83% complex) exceeding 35% minimum, but EU hosting and inference processing confirmation absent.\", \"citations\": [\"pilot-0\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Aster pilot meets automation floor (79% simple, 71% complex); Birch falls short on complex tickets (43%), risking unresolved-ticket costs.\", \"citations\": [\"pilot-1\", \"pilot-2\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Cost worksheet empty; cannot verify year-one total (software $74k + usage + setup + residual human work) against 3% tolerance or deadline feasibility.\", \"citations\": [\"workload\", \"comparison-0\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Cobalt\", \"kind\": \"contract\"}}, {\"choice\": \"Cobalt\", \"confidence\": 0.72, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"Cobalt meets cost tolerance: $57,257 total is 23% below $74k software budget and within 3% of minimum ($55,661 threshold).\", \"citations\": [\"quote-0\", \"pilot-0\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"Cobalt automation rate 87.4% exceeds 35% minimum; pilot showed 92% simple and 83% complex resolution rates on buyer workload mix.\", \"citations\": [\"pilot-0\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"SSO and complete export confirmed for all candidates; EU hosting availability stated but deployment scope confirmation required before contract.\", \"citations\": [\"quote-0\", \"quote-1\", \"quote-2\", \"comparison-0\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Cobalt\", \"kind\": \"contract\"}}, {\"choice\": \"DEFER\", \"confidence\": 0.0, \"findings\": [{\"claim\": \"Cobalt seat cost ($6804/yr) fits budget, but EU hosting, automation rate, migration timeline, and total cost remain unconfirmed.\", \"citations\": [\"comparison-0\", \"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"51% complex tickets require \\u226535% automation; no candidate provides measured automation performance on this workload mix.\", \"citations\": [\"workload\"]}, {\"claim\": \"46-day migration deadline is critical; only Cobalt mentions setup (14 days), but migration scope and feasibility are unstated.\", \"citations\": [\"comparison-0\", \"workload\"]}], \"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Cobalt\", \"kind\": \"pilot\"}}], \"checks\": [{\"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Birch\", \"kind\": \"contract\"}, \"document\": {\"id\": \"quote-2\", \"title\": \"Birch deployment quote\", \"kind\": \"contract\", \"publisher\": \"Birch-commercial\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Birch: $18 per seat per month for 12 months; $0.03 per automated resolution, no free allowance; one-time setup $2350. A resolution avoids one human-handled ticket in this planning model. SSO included: True; complete export: True. No other discounts are committed.\"}, \"interpretation\": {\"claim\": \"Birch quotes $18/seat/month for 12 months plus $2,350 setup, with $0.03 per automated resolution and no free allowance. SSO and complete export included.\", \"citation\": \"quote-2\", \"limitation\": \"Quote is from October 2026 and represents Birch-commercial's stated terms only. Actual costs depend on seat count and resolution volume. No discounts beyond those listed are committed.\"}}, {\"request\": {\"candidate\": \"Cobalt\", \"kind\": \"contract\"}, \"document\": {\"id\": \"quote-0\", \"title\": \"Cobalt deployment quote\", \"kind\": \"contract\", \"publisher\": \"Cobalt-commercial\", \"revision\": \"2026-10-04-demo\", \"text\": \"Cobalt: $27 per seat per month for 12 months; $0.11 per automated resolution, no free allowance; one-time setup $3250. A resolution avoids one human-handled ticket in this planning model. SSO included: True; complete export: True. No other discounts are committed.\"}, \"interpretation\": {\"claim\": \"Cobalt deployment costs $27/seat/month for 12 months plus $3,250 setup fee, with $0.11 per automated resolution and no free allowance. SSO and complete export included.\", \"citation\": \"quote-0\", \"limitation\": \"Quote does not specify seat count, total contract value, or approval status. Pricing assumes 12-month term and may not reflect negotiated discounts or volume adjustments.\"}}], \"cost_worksheet\": [{\"candidate\": \"Aster\", \"automation_rate\": 0.7492, \"software_usd\": 35319.86, \"residual_human_usd\": 86676.48, \"total_usd\": 121996.34, \"citations\": [\"quote-1\", \"pilot-1\", \"workload\"]}, {\"candidate\": \"Birch\", \"automation_rate\": 0.4937, \"software_usd\": 7454.74, \"residual_human_usd\": 174977.28, \"total_usd\": 182432.02, \"citations\": [\"quote-2\", \"pilot-2\", \"workload\"]}, {\"candidate\": \"Cobalt\", \"automation_rate\": 0.8741, \"software_usd\": 13746.2, \"residual_human_usd\": 43511.04, \"total_usd\": 57257.24, \"citations\": [\"quote-0\", \"pilot-0\", \"workload\"]}], \"role\": \"procurement reviewer\"}"}], "max_tokens": 3072, "temperature": 0, "reasoning": {"enabled": false}, "provider": {"only": ["Anthropic"], "order": ["Anthropic"], "allow_fallbacks": false, "require_parameters": true, "max_price": {"prompt": 1, "completion": 5}}, "stream": false, "response_format": {"type": "json_schema", "json_schema": {"name": "reviewer_output", "strict": true, "schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"choice": {"type": "string", "enum": ["Aster", "Birch", "Cobalt", "DEFER"]}, "confidence": {"type": "number"}, "request": {"type": "object", "properties": {"candidate": {"type": "string", "enum": ["Aster", "Birch", "Cobalt"]}, "kind": {"type": "string", "enum": ["contract", "scope", "pilot", "rollout"]}}, "required": ["candidate", "kind"], "additionalProperties": false}, "limitations": {"type": "string"}, "candidate_facts": {"type": "object", "properties": {"Aster": {"type": "object", "properties": {"scope": {"$ref": "#/$defs/scope"}, "quote": {"$ref": "#/$defs/quote"}, "pilot": {"$ref": "#/$defs/pilot"}, "rollout": {"$ref": "#/$defs/rollout"}}, "required": ["scope", "quote", "pilot", "rollout"], "additionalProperties": false}, "Birch": {"type": "object", "properties": {"scope": {"$ref": "#/$defs/scope"}, "quote": {"$ref": "#/$defs/quote"}, "pilot": {"$ref": "#/$defs/pilot"}, "rollout": {"$ref": "#/$defs/rollout"}}, "required": ["scope", "quote", "pilot", "rollout"], "additionalProperties": false}, "Cobalt": {"type": "object", "properties": {"scope": {"$ref": "#/$defs/scope"}, "quote": {"$ref": "#/$defs/quote"}, "pilot": {"$ref": "#/$defs/pilot"}, "rollout": {"$ref": "#/$defs/rollout"}}, "required": ["scope", "quote", "pilot", "rollout"], "additionalProperties": false}}, "required": ["Aster", "Birch", "Cobalt"], "additionalProperties": false}}, "required": ["choice", "confidence", "request", "limitations", "candidate_facts"], "additionalProperties": false, "$defs": {"scope": {"type": "object", "properties": {"storage_region": {"type": "string"}, "processing_region": {"type": "string"}, "unknown_fields": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "enum": ["storage_region", "processing_region"]}}, "citation": {"type": "string", "enum": ["", "comparison-2", "rollout-1", "quote-1", "pilot-2", "quote-0", "rollout-2", "workload", "comparison-0", "scope-1", "scope-2", "pilot-1", "quote-2", "rollout-0", "comparison-1", "scope-0", "pilot-0"]}, "excerpt": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["storage_region", "processing_region", "unknown_fields", "citation", "excerpt"], "additionalProperties": false}, "quote": {"type": "object", "properties": {"seat_price": {"type": "number"}, "outcome_price": {"type": "number"}, "setup_usd": {"type": "number"}, "sso": {"type": "boolean"}, "complete_export": {"type": "boolean"}, "unknown_fields": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "enum": ["seat_price", "outcome_price", "setup_usd", "sso", "complete_export"]}}, "citation": {"type": "string", "enum": ["", "comparison-2", "rollout-1", "quote-1", "pilot-2", "quote-0", "rollout-2", "workload", "comparison-0", "scope-1", "scope-2", "pilot-1", "quote-2", "rollout-0", "comparison-1", "scope-0", "pilot-0"]}, "excerpt": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["seat_price", "outcome_price", "setup_usd", "sso", "complete_export", "unknown_fields", "citation", "excerpt"], "additionalProperties": false}, "pilot": {"type": "object", "properties": {"simple_resolved": {"type": "integer"}, "simple_total": {"type": "integer"}, "complex_resolved": {"type": "integer"}, "complex_total": {"type": "integer"}, "unknown_fields": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "enum": ["simple_resolved", "simple_total", "complex_resolved", "complex_total"]}}, "citation": {"type": "string", "enum": ["", "compariso